          "key": "record_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Record boundary and stop condition",
          "guidance": "Use this courier delivery receipt with the applicable customer commitment, carrier terms, site policy, and retention requirements. Do not infer acceptance or release from a signature alone; unresolved identity, count, condition, custody, or proof issues require an owner, escalation, and documented disposition."
